    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dff2c6696334f6383b9edf66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "盛大的欢呼声与选手们的表情皆阐述着比赛的\n充实程度。相信今天的比赛缔造的兴奋\n一定让世界变得比昨天更加美丽了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4195db347bcc6ba8ad56c16698a7ea281851604024130cbda8ec79d1e70bf102",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6db34f3fed6b180cf6eb89db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b13ab2ba99028fc735a70a38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但可不能就此止步。\n下一个目标就是春古马三冠\n最终战“宝冢纪念”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb744566cf0916e7eceda43b1cf4e8eeaa4d150d50cfdbd4411df28733f114d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11865ad20478e6d1deb2bb93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（春）结束后・美丽春天",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d875c4f7a6e3547961c0f4df363dd16a9b96dca9a020c61182faffa9cbca8f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:534b9f4865915dda83c66778",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以强悍鲜明的跑法称霸“宝冢纪念”的选手\n站上被欢呼声笼罩的赛道中心。\n该人当然正是美丽周日。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebd6f2b7777f091557c76bff8a6f4f8d1f7271057054af5d8f6ace41cd1e14d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29f593af4e0fc8da898238a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“透过比赛传递美丽”……\n如同在“天皇赏（春）”感受到的一样，\n世界美丽化计划进行得相当顺利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ea99d39e4f03a9d3bc506408d25da2e601bbd3fb31c6ea2e63e62f7e3fbbebd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4ced091e485d7a9c40152e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石凝神倾听实际上早已平息的欢呼声。\n今天这场比赛无疑地震撼了\n原本身处黑暗中的她的内心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4210fb5274128b6913c31c6e0fae5743eefa9c6ed8a9b019e4cd84b926e5772",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46b362a9070a612c4d52b9ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽的光辉将互相结合，不断膨胀。\n在这种预感之中，美丽周日迎接了\n准备挑战“天皇赏（秋）”的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a23af1ea1833952a3a350ea0d6e65db3bcdfb887176c2e41baa579b1a719eaea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:810932e7086fcd56e6ea4239",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・美妙的预感☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2cee655a88774aae40933648443a98d3e70de5c3f88800aa7cf39a8c542153b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
