    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d423cd6caa0a9b8e070bef9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她于这个世界孕育的美丽，\n无疑地已成长到最大极限。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e116f70f5e867c38d152b3ca9ce9b03d6693ebfc99f124c10a920882fe708072",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
