    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ab11fffcfa9abb44e7e61a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本C结束后・奇迹的连锁",
      "source_fingerprint": "2276e041edd5f973f8294257aeb22a9c35abaa9adef26f116a7696fc74c3a4d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43cf60679df6cfff8483231c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众多强者来到“有马纪念”齐聚一堂，\n而美丽周日称霸了\n这场名留青史的精彩对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb45b118c4c4f44ec5989a3c1f7d45a8e29306784d9ddc8c63723066fede849d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0348738607908ac2381634f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她想透过这场比赛传递的事物──\n大家都正在呼吸、心跳……一起活在\n这个满是奇迹、喜悦与惊奇的世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92b202a7289033a20e5827905885d5d9766e576bddf54a2de37acdbf58d3c448",
